flowchart TB
  USER[用户 / Agent]

  subgraph CONTROL[控制面：决定测什么、何时执行]
    PQL[product-quality-loop\n产品知识与测试编排\nProjectPackSnapshot / TestSelection / TestingRunRecord]
    TPC[Testing Packages\nPQL 侧：验证输入并编译 StructuredPlan\n这是库，不是网络服务]
    NYX[NyxID\n身份认证 / approval / 路由 / 审计]
    TOOL[Talos Testing Tool\nget_capabilities / submit / get / events / cancel]
    RUN[QARun Store\n保存 run 状态、幂等键、输入和结果引用]
    SCH[Talos Scheduler\npool / capability / placement\nTestingTask / lease / generation / fence]
  end

  subgraph MACHINE[执行面：在真实机器上产生本机副作用]
    WORKER[talos-worker\nclaim / heartbeat / cancel / result\n固定 TestingExecutor]
    LQR[Local QA Runtime\nadmission / workspace / environment\nprocess / port / browser / cleanup]
    TPE[Testing Packages\nRuntime 侧：typed action / observation\nassertion / CaseResultSet / EvidenceManifest]
    CHROME[临时 Chromium\n独立 profile / downloads / process group]
  end

  subgraph ARTIFACT[Hosted Artifact plane：长期存储与 ingestion authority]
    STORE[Hosted ArtifactStore\nper-object grant / ingest receipt\nsanitized bytes / opaque ref + digest]
  end

  USER -->|1. 提出测试目标| PQL
  PQL -->|2. 冻结项目知识、资产和选择| PQL
  PQL -->|3. approved InputSet| TPC
  TPC -->|4. StructuredPlan ref + digest| PQL
  PQL -->|5. TestingToolClient\n只发送 refs/digests 和 policy| NYX
  NYX -->|6. 验证 caller、执行 approval、转发| TOOL
  TOOL -->|7. 创建/幂等更新 QARun| RUN
  RUN -->|8. 生成 TestingTask| SCH
  SCH -->|9. 按能力选择 machine\n发 lease + fence| WORKER
  WORKER -->|10. 通过 worker 通道 claim/heartbeat/result| NYX
  NYX -->|11. 转发 worker API 请求| SCH
  WORKER -->|12. 传入 exact plan + signed LocalQARequestAuthorization| LQR
  LQR -->|13. 使用测试语义库执行| TPE
  LQR -->|14. 创建并控制| CHROME
  TPE -->|15. 产生 assertion 和 case 事实| LQR
  LQR -->|16. 申请 grant 并上传校验后的 bounded evidence| STORE
  LQR -->|17. CleanupReceipt + CaseResultSet ref| WORKER
  WORKER -->|18. bounded result + terminal state| NYX
  NYX -->|19. 转发 result| SCH
  SCH -->|20. 更新 QARun snapshot/events| RUN
  PQL -->|21. get/events 轮询或消费事件| NYX
  NYX -->|22. 转发查询| TOOL
  TOOL -->|23. 读取 QARun snapshot/events| RUN
  RUN -->|24. bounded snapshot/events| TOOL
  TOOL -->|25. 状态、结果引用和 digest| NYX
  NYX -->|26. 返回 bounded response| PQL
  PQL -->|27. 保存 TestingRunRecord 关联\n不推断 Final Quality| PQL
  PQL -->|28. 返回结果给 Agent| USER

  PQL -.->|不负责 machine / lease / Chrome| SCH
  TPC -.->|不持有 NyxID token\n不调用 Talos| NYX
  TPE -.->|不拥有 process / port / workspace| LQR

  classDef actor fill:#F5F7FA,stroke:#52606D,color:#1F2933;
  classDef planning fill:#FFF4E5,stroke:#C77800,color:#4A2B00;
  classDef transport fill:#E7F6F3,stroke:#167D74,color:#123C39;
  classDef control fill:#EAF0FB,stroke:#3867B7,color:#17365D;
  classDef local fill:#EAF6E8,stroke:#4B8F43,color:#173C16;
  classDef store fill:#F4ECF8,stroke:#7950A3,color:#392150;

  class USER actor;
  class PQL,TPC,TPE planning;
  class NYX transport;
  class TOOL,RUN,SCH control;
  class WORKER,LQR,CHROME local;
  class STORE store;
